    "description": "## *Bacillus bingmayongensis* (*B. cereus* group Rare Species)\n\n#### Maximum-likelihood phylogeny of all *B. bingmayongensis* genomes/MAGs\n\n- **The phylogeny was constructed (via IQ-TREE v2.2.5) using 882 core genes detected (via Panaroo v1.3.4) in all *B. bingmayongensis* genomes plus an outgroup, the [*B. pseudomycoides* type strain](https://nextstrain.org/community/vigzy77/BTracker/Bacillus-cereus-group/All-Species(Mash-distance-NJ)?f_Strain=DSM%2012442).**\n\n- **The phylogeny is rooted using the aforementioned outgroup (omitted for readability), with branch lengths reported in substitutions per site.**",
